2026-07-27T08:24:09.0184584Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0245231Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0245944Z i /tmp/RtmpnOSuGU/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0246323Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0246757Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0247474Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0248083Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0249256Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0249925Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0492633Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:09.0602132Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:09.1028015Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:24:09.1179579Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
